+"""Unit tests for memory.list InputModel validation and cursor helpers (T-7.1).
+
+Pure unit tests — no DB. Covers:
+  - MemoryListInput field defaults and constraint validation
+  - _encode_cursor / _decode_cursor round-trip and error handling
+  - MemoryListItem / MemoryListOutput model behaviour
+  - MemoryListTool class attributes
+
+Previously-documented bugs (now fixed):
+  (b) cursor value passed as ISO str param without ::timestamptz cast in SQL —
+      now casts with ::timestamptz.
+  (d) _decode_cursor did not catch TypeError / KeyError for non-list JSON —
+      now catches (JSONDecodeError, IndexError, ValueError, TypeError, KeyError).
+  (e) team_id model was UUID|None but description says "UUID or team name" + "*"
+      — now accepts UUID | str | None.
+"""
+
